    "reviews": "\u201cMoncage offers a gorgeous blend of narrative threads and teasing puzzles, that makes for a game of real elegance.\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br><br>\u201cIf you're in it for the love of the puzzles, then there's definitely a lot to admire here.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cMoncage is an intelligent puzzle game, and its perspective-based riddles stretched my imagination as each scene flowed beautifully into the next.\u201d<br>Gameinformer<br>",
